## 🧠 Learning Highlights

- Implemented WebSockets for real-time two-way communication using `Socket.io`.
- Secured user data with hashed passwords and protected routes via JWTs.
- Boosted message delivery speed with optimized socket handling.
- Leveraged Vite and React for a responsive, fast-loading interface.
- Enhanced UX with emojis and a polished UI.

